    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "narration_text": "The existing stack includes adjusted engagement-effect estimation; row and SKU-cluster bootstraps; shuffled-treatment placebo; temporal falsification; overlap; stockout assessment; model robustness; synthetic confounding sensitivity; and reliability reconciliation. Each tests a different limitation.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 24,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "drawon",
        "visual_intent": "Large multi-row Phase 5 diagnostic inventory.",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "CausalCoutureWeek11",
          "props": {
            "kind": "diagnostics"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B02.mp4",
            "at": "2026-10-14T15:00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 19.03,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B02.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:CausalCoutureWeek11",
        "at": "2026-10-14T15:20:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "narration_text": "Valid diagnostics can raise different concerns. Row-level uncertainty may look narrow while cluster-based uncertainty widens. Observed-control models may look stable while hypothetical confounding stress still shows sensitivity. Interpret the outputs together.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 23,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "drawon",
        "visual_intent": "Two paired examples of legitimate diagnostic tension.",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "CausalCoutureWeek11",
          "props": {
            "kind": "problem"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B03.mp4",
            "at": "2026-10-14T15:00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 15.62,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B03.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:CausalCoutureWeek11",
        "at": "2026-10-14T15:20:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "narration_text": "Week 11 builds a consistent framework: separate execution from interpretation, reconcile conflicts conservatively, and assess decision readiness without treating diagnostic agreement as proof of causation.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 19,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "drawon",
        "visual_intent": "Three-stage Week 11 objective flow.",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "CausalCoutureWeek11",
          "props": {
            "kind": "objective"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B04.mp4",
            "at": "2026-10-14T15:00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B04.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 12.48,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B04.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:CausalCoutureWeek11",
        "at": "2026-10-14T15:20:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "narration_text": "The framework has two dimensions. Execution status asks whether a diagnostic produced an interpretable result. Evidence signal asks what that result suggests about the observational estimate. Keeping them separate preserves analytical limits.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 23,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "drawon",
        "visual_intent": "Large execution-status by evidence-signal matrix.",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "CausalCoutureWeek11",
          "props": {
            "kind": "axes"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B05.mp4",
            "at": "2026-10-14T15:00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B05.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 14.53,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B05.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:CausalCoutureWeek11",
        "at": "2026-10-14T15:20:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "narration_text": "Execution status has four categories. Available returned interpretable information. Inconclusive lacked sufficient observations, variation, or analytical support. Error encountered a processing problem. Not Reviewed has not yet been evaluated.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 25,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "drawon",
        "visual_intent": "Four execution status cards.",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "CausalCoutureWeek11",
          "props": {
            "kind": "execution"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B06.mp4",
            "at": "2026-10-14T15:00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B06.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 15.27,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B06.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:CausalCoutureWeek11",
        "at": "2026-10-14T15:20:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "narration_text": "Evidence signal also has four categories. Reassuring Within Scope found no major warning within that test. Caution identifies a limitation. Mixed combines both kinds of evidence. Undetermined lacks enough evidence for a defensible interpretation.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 23,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "drawon",
        "visual_intent": "Four evidence-signal cards.",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "CausalCoutureWeek11",
          "props": {
            "kind": "evidence"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B07.mp4",
            "at": "2026-10-14T15:00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B07.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 14.98,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B07.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:CausalCoutureWeek11",
        "at": "2026-10-14T15:20:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B08",
      "narration_text": "Successful execution does not automatically mean reassuring evidence. An unavailable diagnostic cannot be treated as having passed. Running a calculation, interpreting it, and establishing causal certainty are different things.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 18,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "drawon",
        "visual_intent": "Successful execution not equal reassuring evidence.",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "CausalCoutureWeek11",
          "props": {
            "kind": "distinction"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B08.mp4",
            "at": "2026-10-14T15:00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B08.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 13.74,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B08.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:CausalCoutureWeek11",
        "at": "2026-10-14T15:20:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "narration_text": "For row-level versus SKU-cluster bootstrap, document both results, consider the independent SKU count, and never automatically prefer the narrower interval. Within-product dependence can affect uncertainty. No actual Week 11 interval is claimed here.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 24,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "drawon",
        "visual_intent": "Side-by-side bootstrap comparison and review rules.",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "CausalCoutureWeek11",
          "props": {
            "kind": "bootstrap"
          },
          "rendered": {
