        "src": "media/B15.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:CausalCoutureWeek11",
        "at": "2026-10-14T15:20:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B16",
      "narration_text": "The principal deliverable is the Markdown methodology document, Causal Couture, Phase 5: Causal Evidence Interpretation and Decision Readiness, at docs slash week11 causal evidence decision readiness dot M D. It contains inventories, classifications, conflict guidance, review procedures, limitations, and a future evidence-review template. Findings remain blank until real outputs are inspected. Week 11 changed no FastAPI backend, estimation module, or frontend interface.",
