    {
      "beat_id": "B17",
      "narration_text": "Week 11 moves from producing diagnostics toward interpreting evidence responsibly. An observational estimate is not enough. Ask: did the diagnostics execute, what does each test, where do they disagree, what remains limited, and is any decision-oriented interpretation justified? Move from execution status, to evidence signal, reconciliation, decision readiness, and responsible interpretation.",
